{"title":"LaTeX操作","uid":"0b720979fc7391d027a05e038a05d97d","slug":"LaTeX","date":"2025-06-07T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2025-10-23T14:51:56.273Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/LaTeX.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/images/cover/LaTeX.webp","content":"<div class=\"custom-quote danger\">\n<span class=\"custom-quote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M19.76 5.23C15.84 5.23 12 2 12 2C12 2 8.15996 5.23 4.23996 5.23C4.23996 5.23 1.86996 16.99 12 22C22.13 16.99 19.76 5.23 19.76 5.23Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M12 8V13\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M11.99 16H12\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"custom-quote-title\">注意</p>\n<p><p>本文为编者自用，所使用的软件为<strong>TeXStudio</strong>，设备系统为<strong>macOS Public 非 Beta 最高配置</strong>。<br>Mac系统和Windows系统的键盘符号对应如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Mac</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Win</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌘</code> (<code>command</code>, <code>cmd</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>ctrl</code> (control)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌥</code> (<code>option</code>, <code>opt</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>alt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌃</code> (<code>control</code>, <code>ctrl</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\">无对应键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⇧</code> (<code>shift</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⇧</code> (<code>shift</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</p>\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"编译器设置\"><a href=\"#编译器设置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"编译器设置\"></a>编译器设置</h1><p>非拉丁字体（如中文、韩文、日文等）使用<code>XeLaTeX</code>，因为<code>XeLaTeX</code>对应的<code>XeTeX</code>对字体的支持更好，允许用户使用操作系统字体来代替<code>TeX</code>的标准字体。在<code>\\documentclass</code>前面进行设定，即<code>.tex</code>主文件（即编译文件）第一行。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">%!TEX program = xelatex</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>拉丁字体（如英文）使用<code>pdfLaTeX</code>，其默认字体为Computer Modern Unicode (CMU) Serif。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">%!TEX program = pdflatex</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"字体大小\"><a href=\"#字体大小\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"字体大小\"></a>字体大小</h1><p>全文字号设置（默认为10pt）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\documentclass</span>[12pt]{article} <span class=\"comment\">% 只能设置 10pt, 11pt, 12pt</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>部分内容设置</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\fontsize</span>{字体尺寸}{行间距}<span class=\"keyword\">\\selectfont</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>图例字体大小设置</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\usepackage</span>[font=footnotesize]{caption}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">命令</th>\n<th align=\"left\">对应字号</th>\n<th align=\"left\">中文字号</th>\n<th align=\"left\">备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\tiny</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">5pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">八号</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\scriptsize</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">7pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">小六(+)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\footnotesize</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">8pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">六号(+)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\small</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">9pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">小五</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\normalsize</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">10pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">五号(-)</td>\n<td align=\"left\">默认正文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\large</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">12pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">小四</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\Large</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">14.4pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">四号(+)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\LARGE</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">17.28pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">小二(-)</td>\n<td align=\"left\">默认标题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\huge</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">20.74pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">二号(-)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>\\Huge</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">24.88pt</td>\n<td align=\"left\">小一(+)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h1 id=\"正文开始\"><a href=\"#正文开始\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"正文开始\"></a>正文开始</h1><p>常规模版</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\documentclass</span>{article} </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">% 该文档为“文章”，可替换report、book、beamer等</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\title</span>{<span class=\"keyword\">\\LaTeX</span> 基础}</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\author</span>{Guanxu WANG}</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\date</span>{<span class=\"keyword\">\\today</span>}</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">% 引言区（放一些需要加载的包）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\usepackage</span>{ctex} <span class=\"comment\">% 中文加载包</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\usepackage</span>{amsmath} <span class=\"comment\">% 数学公式包</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\usepackage</span>{graphicx} <span class=\"comment\">% 插入图片包</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\usepackage</span>{caption}</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\begin</span>{document}</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">% 正文</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\end</span>{document}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"数学公式\"><a href=\"#数学公式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"数学公式\"></a>数学公式</h1><p>需引用的包</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\usepackage</span>{amsmath}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"数学模式\"><a href=\"#数学模式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"数学模式\"></a>数学模式</h2><ol>\n<li>行内模式（inline）：<br>使用 <code>$ ... $</code> 可以插入行内公式；</li>\n<li>行间模式(display)：<br>使用 <code>\\[ ... \\]</code> 或 <code>$$ ... $$</code> 可以插入行间公式，并使文本居中。如果需要对行间公式进行编号，则可以使用 equation 环境，即</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight latex\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\begin</span>{equation}</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">% Your equation(s).</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">\\end</span>{equation}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"上下标\"><a href=\"#上下标\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"上下标\"></a>上下标</h2><p>在数学模式中，上标为<code>^</code>，下标为<code>_</code>。它默认只作用于之后的一个字符，如果想对连续的几个字符起作用，将这些字符用花括号 <code>{}</code> 括起来，例如 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.131ex\" height=\"2.244ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 6245.8 991.7\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D467\" d=\"M347 338Q337 338 294 349T231 360Q211 360 197 356T174 346T162 335T155 324L153 320Q150 317 138 317Q117 317 117 325Q117 330 120 339Q133 378 163 406T229 440Q241 442 246 442Q271 442 291 425T329 392T367 375Q389 375 411 408T434 441Q435 442 449 442H462Q468 436 468 434Q468 430 463 420T449 399T432 377T418 358L411 349Q368 298 275 214T160 106L148 94L163 93Q185 93 227 82T290 71Q328 71 360 90T402 140Q406 149 409 151T424 153Q443 153 443 143Q443 138 442 134Q425 72 376 31T278 -11Q252 -11 232 6T193 40T155 57Q111 57 76 -3Q70 -11 59 -11H54H41Q35 -5 35 -2Q35 13 93 84Q132 129 225 214T340 322Q352 338 347 338Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(498,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D451\" d=\"M366 683Q367 683 438 688T511 694Q523 694 523 686Q523 679 450 384T375 83T374 68Q374 26 402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487H491Q506 153 506 145Q506 140 503 129Q49